    lessonId: "l12-2-docs",
    title: 'Generar Documentación de API',
    instructions: 'Crea un sistema para generar documentación de API.\n\n**Requisitos:**\n- `APIDocGenerator()` crea generador\n- `ScanModule(module)` escanea módulo\n- `GenerateAPIDocs()` genera documentación\n- `ExportJSON(path)` exporta a JSON\n- `ExportHTML(path)` exporta a HTML\n\n**Pista:** Analiza el código para extraer funciones',
    starterCode: 'local APIDocGenerator = {}\n\nfunction APIDocGenerator:new()\n  local self = setmetatable({}, APIDocGenerator)\n  self.modules = {}\n  self.apiDocs = {}\n  return self\nend\n\nfunction APIDocGenerator:ScanModule(module)\n  -- Escanea módulo\nend\n\nfunction APIDocGenerator:GenerateAPIDocs()\n  -- Genera documentación\nend\n\nfunction APIDocGenerator:ExportJSON(path)\n  -- Exporta a JSON\nend\n\nreturn APIDocGenerator',
    solution: 'local APIDocGenerator = {}\nAPIDocGenerator.__index = APIDocGenerator\n\nfunction APIDocGenerator:new()\n  local self = setmetatable({}, APIDocGenerator)\n  self.modules = {}\n  self.apiDocs = {}\n  print("APIDocGenerator inicializado")\n  return self\nend\n\nfunction APIDocGenerator:ScanModule(module)\n  local moduleInfo = {\n    name = module.name or "Unknown",\n    functions = module.functions or {},\n    description = module.description or ""\n  }\n  \n  table.insert(self.modules, moduleInfo)\n  print("Modulo escaneado: " .. moduleInfo.name)\n  return moduleInfo\nend\n\nfunction APIDocGenerator:GenerateAPIDocs()\n  local docs = {\n    title = "API Documentation",\n    version = "1.0.0",\n    modules = self.modules\n  }\n  \n  self.apiDocs = docs\n  print("Documentacion generada")\n  return docs\nend\n\nfunction APIDocGenerator:ExportJSON(path)\n  print("Exportando JSON: " .. path)\n  return "{ title: API Docs }"\nend\n\nfunction APIDocGenerator:ExportHTML(path)\n  print("Exportando HTML: " .. path)\n  return "<html><body>API Docs</body></html>"\nend\n\nreturn APIDocGenerator',
